<title>ITALY: Olivetti fails to reopen, next try Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Olivetti fails to reopen, next try Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in troubled information technology group Olivetti failed to resume trading before the Milan bourse closed at 1500 GMT and dealers said the next try to restart trade will be on Tuesday morning.</p>
<p>Olivetti shares earlier went 20 percent limit down triggering automatic suspension at 600 lire after they were offered at 595 lire.</p>
